0..63 Comment "//! This source derives univalence paths at signature corollas."
64..67 Comment "//!"
68..142 Comment "//! `ua[1, 4]` derives a path between the degree telescopes of two `Magma`"
143..210 Comment "//! models. It reads their translator tables one corolla at a time."
211..214 Comment "//!"
215..288 Comment "//! Transport applies each corolla translator. Tables that agree at every"
289..367 Comment "//! element produce the same path. A univalence map acts as a typoid function."
368..371 Comment "//!"
372..447 Comment "//! - cites: [Shulman-2015-univalence_inverse_diagrams_homotopy_canonicity]"
448..494 Comment "//! - cites: [Petrakis-2022-univalent_typoids]"
495..498 Comment "//!"
499..675 Comment "//! [Shulman-2015-univalence_inverse_diagrams_homotopy_canonicity]: https://doi.org/10.1017/S0960129514000565 \"Shulman, Univalence for Inverse Diagrams and Homotopy Canonicity\""
676..777 Comment "//! [Petrakis-2022-univalent_typoids]: https://arxiv.org/abs/2205.06651 \"Petrakis, Univalent Typoids\""
779..856 Comment "// The magma, the swap, the identity on the booleans and the unit\'s identity."
